# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# This matters here specifically: the API builds and runs in Linux containers,
# and a shell script or Dockerfile checked out with CRLF fails with errors that
# look nothing like their cause ("/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter").
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
